nabeach.com/blog/post/fun-free-things-to-do-in-daytona-beach/","source_title":"15 Fun, Free Things to Do in Daytona Beach","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2025-05-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Park access requires no admission or purchase; bringing food is optional, and no on-site purchase is necessary.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"daytona-beach-bandshell-summer-concert","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Daytona Beach Bandshell","title":"Catch a Friday Bandshell Concert","subtitle":"Free general-admission music at the oceanfront amphitheater","notes":"Bring a chair, arrive before the 7:15 p.m. start, and settle into the general-admission area for a free summer show.","short_summary":"Gather for live tribute music in a landmark coquina amphitheater without purchasing a ticket.","evidence_claim":"The 2026 Sounds of Summer page says Friday concerts run June 12–August 28 at 7:15 p.m. and general admission is free.","source_url":"https://www.daytonabeach.com/events/festivals-and-music/bandshell-concerts/friday-night-concerts/","source_title":"Daytona Beach Sounds of Summer Concert Series","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"General admission is free for the published 2026 Friday concerts; optional VIP seating and parking may cost extra.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
